tip: | Look at the mug. | The light comes from the left, so the same blue runs light, mid and dark from left to right, in straight bands.
tip: 3 | Bands follow the form. | A round side turns away from the light slowly. Each band is one ramp step, and the handle follows the same rule.
tip: | Try it. | Put the light on the right: with the Pencil, swap the lightest band on the left for the darkest blue. The mug turns round, because the light decides the bands. | pencil
